<h1>Retail</h1>
<p class="story-lead">Store faults went into a group chat, and vendor visits sat on a head-office sheet. A repeat fault never showed the last visit.</p>
<p>A cooler failed over the weekend and the vendor arrived without the earlier notes. The store and the office each thought the other had closed it.</p>
<p>They put store requests, assets, and vendor visits on one record. The next visit starts from the last job instead of a blank form.</p>
